    "title": "Smart Watch - Clock Wallpaper",
    "description": "Smart Watch - Clock Wallpaper app having Beautiful Designs of watch to set it as Clock Live Wallpaper.\r\n\r\nApp having Smart Neon Analog and Digital watch for your smartphone mobile. Simple way to display current time, date and day of the week using Smart, Digital and Analog Clock Live Wallpaper.\r\n\r\nApp having collection of matched wallpaper with neon clocks.\r\n\r\nYou can customize the following features:\r\n\u2714 Easy to manage for colour combination with clocks and background.\r\n\u2714 Customize clock colour, size, and position\r\n\u2714 Pick customize wallpaper set from Gallery / Camera as well.\r\n\u2714 Show date, day of the week, seconds\r\n\u2714 Show on Lock screen as well\r\n\r\nSmart, Digital and Analog clock is perfectly designed to display accurate time, date and beyond on a live clock wallpaper.\r\n\r\nNeon Clocks are very attractive and eye-caching. Each and Every clock design with special match background.\r\n\r\nDecorate your mobile with a Neon style using Smart Watch live clock wallpaper.\r\n\r\n\ud83d\udca5 Analog clock Styles\r\n- Large Collection of Analog clock with perfect matched wallpaper and single click setup as live wallpaper.\r\n\r\n\ud83d\udca5 Digital clock Styles\r\n- Just few click and set Digital clock live wallpaper on your smartphone. Beautiful clock and matched neon wallpaper to set easily.\r\n\r\n\ud83d\udc4d Highly Customizable Clocks\r\n- In addition, App having feature to customize neon color of clocks, hours, minute and second hands. Easily change clock style and wallpaper.\r\n\r\n\ud83d\udc4d Resize and Reposition of Clock\r\n- Easy to resize clock, Touch to move clock anywhere and finally set it as Clock Live Wallpaper.\r\n\r\n\ud83d\udc4d Amazing Wallpaper designs\r\n- Lots of HD black wallpapers available to select and set neon Clock. There are different styles of watches to set selected neon colours and customized colours.\r\n\r\nThe best key part of <b>Smart Watch - Clock Wallpaper</b> is its gorgeous clock styles, designs and Neon Wallpaper.\r\n\r\nThank you for your time",
